## Notes

The WA nominal hours are distinct from the national training.gov.au data because:
1. Nominal hours are a **state-level funding mechanism** unique to WA
2. Each state/territory may have different hour allocations for the same unit
3. WA uses nominal hours for calculating training subsidies and RTO funding

For accurate WA VET funding calculations, this integration is essential.
